Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:14:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): lane shadow mode: classify and report without
 holding, capping or reordering [daveey]

kanban.admission.lane_shadow is the rollout step before enforcement; lane_assigned records would_gate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
